  "titulo": "Difference between cuánto and cuanto (with and without accent)",
  "subtitulo": "¿Cuánto cuesta? vs cuanto antes: the accent asks or exclaims.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Cuánto (with accent) asks or exclaims how much / how many, also in indirect questions. Cuanto (no accent) is relative: cuanto antes, en cuanto, cuanto más.",
